.\r\n\r\n## What I did\r\n\r\nThis is a cheap/hacky way to make sure that the variable is unique.\r\n\r\nConsider the following MDX:\r\n\r\n```md\r\nimport { foo } from './button.stories';\r\n\r\n<Story story={foo} />\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe compiler was generating the following code (simplified):\r\n\r\n```\r\nimport { foo } from './button.stories';\r\n\r\n// lots of MDX stuff omitted\r\n\r\nexport const fooStory = foo;\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf I made the export named `foo`, it would collide with the import name and the generated code would be invalid. However, this modified the Story ID.\r\n\r\nThis PR modifies the generated code to be:\r\n\r\n```\r\nexport const _foo_ = foo;\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhich preserves the same ID.\r\n\r\n## How to test\r\n\r\nSee attached snapshot & CSF imported MDX example in `official-storybook`.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/12154/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/12154/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/comments/677453061","html_url":"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/issues/12143#issuecomment-677453061","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/12143","id":677453061,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY3NzQ1MzA2MQ==","user":{"login":"shilman","id":488689,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODY4OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/488689?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman","html_url":"https://github.com/shilman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman